       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IOCUSTNM.
      *****************************************************************
      * IO MODULE - THE ONLY PLACE CUST_ARCHIVE IS EVER WRITTEN.       *
      * IT IS NEVER CALLED BY NAME: CALLERS MOVE THE PROGRAM NAME INTO *
      * A VARIABLE AND CALL THAT. WITHOUT RESOLVING THAT INDIRECTION,  *
      * NOTHING REACHES LK-IO-NAME AND CUST_ARCHIVE.ARCH_NAME IS NEVER *
      * REPORTED - EVEN THOUGH IT TAKES THE WIDENED VALUE DIRECTLY.    *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-IO-STATUS             PIC S9(4)       COMP.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-IO-NAME               PIC X(30).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-IO-NAME.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               INSERT INTO CUST_ARCHIVE (ARCH_NAME)
               VALUES (:LK-IO-NAME)
           END-EXEC
           MOVE SQLCODE TO WS-IO-STATUS
           GOBACK.
